---
layout: layout.jinja
description: Trail snacks so good, even Sasquatch comes out of hiding. Pine Cone Crunch, Huckleberry Hustle and four more, by the bag or by subscription.
---
<section class="hero">
	<picture>
		{{ "src/img/hero-tall.jpg" | crop("(max-width: 40rem)", "100vw") }}
		<img src="/img/hero-wide.jpg" alt="A tall, shaggy figure at the edge of a pine forest at sunset" sizes="100vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
	</picture>
	<div class="wrap">
		<h1>Trail snacks with a legendary following.</h1>
		<p>Small-batch snacks for long days outside. Eyewitnesses agree: once you've tried Pine Cone Crunch, you'll be spotted at the trailhead with a bag of it.</p>
		<p class="actions">
			<Button href="/provisions/pine-cone-crunch/">Try Pine Cone Crunch</Button>
			<Button href="/pricing/" variant="inverse">See subscriptions</Button>
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<Section id="featured" title="Spotted on every trail" intro="Three snacks hikers keep reporting. Each one is made in Pine Cone Gap, West Virginia, in batches small enough to carry.">
	<div class="grid">
		{%- for snack in snacks | selectattr("featured") %}
		<Card title="{{ snack.name }}" href="/provisions/{{ snack.slug }}/" image="{{ snack.image }}" alt="{{ snack.imageAlt }}" eyebrow="{{ snack.price | money }} · {{ snack.weight }}">
			<p>{{ snack.tagline }}</p>
		</Card>
		{%- endfor %}
	</div>
	<p><a href="/provisions/">See all six snacks</a></p>
</Section>

<Section id="eyewitnesses" title="What eyewitnesses say" tone="raised">
	<div class="grid">
		{%- for q in testimonials[:3] %}
		<Testimonial name="{{ q.name }}" where="{{ q.where }}">{{ q.quote }}</Testimonial>
		{%- endfor %}
	</div>
</Section>

<Section id="questions" title="Common questions">
	<div class="faq">
		{%- for faq in faqs %}
		<details>
			<summary>{{ faq.q }}</summary>
			<p>{{ faq.a }}</p>
		</details>
		{%- endfor %}
	</div>
</Section>

<Section id="signup" title="Get trail reports" intro="New flavors, restocks and the occasional sighting. One email a month, no more." tone="raised">
	{% include "signup-form.jinja" %}
</Section>
